Metrics: actual message_text returning owned data from prepared JSON rows; collector preallocated outside scope. Same process thread with five equal repeats per variant. Release protocol checked separately.
Columns: tier ops variant case input_messages total_output_bytes total_output_capacity successful_allocator_calls requested_allocator_bytes.
Successful allocator requests include alloc/alloc_zeroed/realloc and full new requested sizes, not active allocation lifetimes, peak, RSS or timing. Ordinary regular String capacity equals length. Every fallback control preserves existing capacities and allocation counts/bytes.
